<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JAN C/A DEFICIT $300 MLN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JAN C/A DEFICIT $300 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's current account</p>
<p>deficit was $300 million in January, up from $294 million in</p>
<p>January 1996 and down from $501 million in December 1996, the</p>
<p>National Bank of Hungary said on Friday.</p>
<p>HUNGARY C/A BALANCE (in million dollars)</p>
<p>    Jan 1997    Dec 1996    Jan-Dec 1996    Jan 1996</p>
<p>	-300	 -501	   -1,678	   -294</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
